; cluster for macroeconomic quantities: inflation, deflation, interest-rate, money-supply, business-cycle.
; macroeconomics studies economy-wide quantities and their rates of change.
; inflation and interest rates are kramanusara quantities: rates of change of price and money.
; sangati roots

(kosha macro-varga
  (vishesa finance-varga)
  (swarupa subanta)
  (yukta kramanusara kaala spanda avastha niyama))
